@startuml C3_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C3 - Plan Generation (Logical Architecture)
left to right direction
hide empty members

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "Operation Plans Feature" as Feature
  rectangle "Shared Utilities" as Shared
}

rectangle "OEM API (NestJS)" as Api {
  rectangle "OperationPlanController" as Controller
  rectangle "OperationPlanService" as PlanService
  rectangle "MissingOperationPlansService" as MissingService
  rectangle "OemVvnService" as VvnService
  rectangle "ExternalClientsService" as ExternalClients
  database "OEM Database" as Db
}

cloud "Identity Provider" as IAM
cloud "VVN Catalog API" as VvnCatalog
cloud "Resource Catalog APIs" as ResourceCatalogs

Operator --> Feature : UI interactions (HTTPS)
Feature --> Shared : gather VVN/resource data
Feature --> Controller : preview/generate/missing
Controller --> IAM : enforce authorisation
Controller --> PlanService : plan generation logic
Controller --> MissingService : missing plan flows
PlanService --> VvnService : load approved VVNs
PlanService --> ExternalClients : load resources/staff/storage
PlanService --> Db : persist plans + tasks
VvnService --> VvnCatalog : fetch approved VVNs
ExternalClients --> ResourceCatalogs : fetch resources
Controller --> Feature : JSON responses

@enduml
